 "beats": [
  {
   "text": "There's a street in Seoul where you are not allowed",
   "startFrame": 11,
   "endFrame": 70
  },
  {
   "text": "to be a tourist after five in the afternoon.",
   "startFrame": 71,
   "endFrame": 140
  },
  {
   "text": "The fine is a hundred thousand won,",
   "startFrame": 141,
   "endFrame": 193
  },
  {
   "text": "and they do collect it.",
   "startFrame": 194,
   "endFrame": 238
  },
  {
   "text": "That's Bukchon, and the reason isn't complicated.",
   "startFrame": 247,
   "endFrame": 307
  },
  {
   "text": "People live there.",
   "startFrame": 308,
   "endFrame": 332
  },
  {
   "text": "Those are houses,",
   "startFrame": 333,
   "endFrame": 360
  },
  {
   "text": "with people inside them,",
   "startFrame": 361,
   "endFrame": 395
  },
  {
   "text": "and a very large number of visitors",
   "startFrame": 396,
   "endFrame": 439
  },
  {
   "text": "walking past the front doors every day.",
   "startFrame": 440,
   "endFrame": 485
  },
  {
   "text": "Which is the thing about Seoul neighbourhoods.",
   "startFrame": 486,
   "endFrame": 538
  },
  {
   "text": "The ones that look like attractions usually aren't,",
   "startFrame": 539,
   "endFrame": 607
  },
  {
   "text": "and the ones that look like nothing usually are.",
   "startFrame": 608,
   "endFrame": 682
  },
  {
   "text": "This one looks three hundred years old.",
   "startFrame": 690,
   "endFrame": 738
  },
  {
   "text": "It went up in the nineteen-twenties,",
   "startFrame": 739,
   "endFrame": 777
  },
  {
   "text": "as a housing development.",
   "startFrame": 778,
   "endFrame": 808
  },
  {
   "text": "Somebody mass-produced hanok and sold them off,",
   "startFrame": 809,
   "endFrame": 867
  },
  {
   "text": "and it survived,",
   "startFrame": 868,
   "endFrame": 891
  },
  {
   "text": "so it's now the oldest",
   "startFrame": 892,
   "endFrame": 916
  },
  {
   "text": "hanok village left in Seoul.",
   "startFrame": 917,
   "endFrame": 952
  },
  {
   "text": "That park is shaped like a railway",
   "startFrame": 953,
   "endFrame": 994
  },
  {
   "text": "because it was one.",
   "startFrame": 995,
   "endFrame": 1015
  },
  {
   "text": "Seoul buried the line",
   "startFrame": 1016,
   "endFrame": 1044
  },
  {
   "text": "and left six kilometres of grass on top of it.",
   "startFrame": 1045,
   "endFrame": 1116
  },
  {
   "text": "That's a steel district,",
   "startFrame": 1125,
   "endFrame": 1155
  },
  {
   "text": "and it's still working.",
   "startFrame": 1156,
   "endFrame": 1182
  },
  {
   "text": "The artists moved in around the workshops,",
   "startFrame": 1183,
   "endFrame": 1231
  },
  {
   "text": "not instead of them.",
   "startFrame": 1232,
   "endFrame": 1268
  },
  {
   "text": "And then there's Euljiro.",
   "startFrame": 1269,
   "endFrame": 1300
  },
  {
   "text": "Metal shops all day,",
   "startFrame": 1301,
   "endFrame": 1329
  },
  {
   "text": "same street, same doors,",
   "startFrame": 1330,
   "endFrame": 1362
  },
  {
   "text": "and bars at night.",
   "startFrame": 1363,
   "endFrame": 1388
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody puts a sign up.",
   "startFrame": 1389,
   "endFrame": 1422
  },
  {
   "text": "You're just supposed to know.",
   "startFrame": 1423,
   "endFrame": 1451
  },
  {
   "text": "So we wrote down all twelve.",
   "startFrame": 1452,
   "endFrame": 1498
  },
  {
   "text": "There's a lot more of this.",
   "startFrame": 1510,
   "endFrame": 1537
  },
  {
   "text": "All twelve Seoul neighbourhoods, on epickor.com.",
   "startFrame": 1539,
   "endFrame": 1606
  }
 ]
}